{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "f4e8b6a2-1c7d-4c3e-9b6f-2d5a8e0c7b11",
    "name": "feed",
    "description": "Feed 流模块接口测试集合。\n\n覆盖接口：\n- GET /feed/list（最新流，复合游标 created_at + id）\n- GET /feed/listByPopularity（热度榜，游标 popularity + id）\n- GET /feed/listByLikesCount（点赞榜，游标 likes_count + id）\n- GET /feed/listByTag（标签过滤，游标 created_at + id）\n- GET /feed/listByFollowing（关注流，需登录）\n\n使用方式：\n1. 启动 API 服务，确认 {{base_url}} 可访问；\n2. 先在“00-准备（可选）”登录并自动提取 {{token}}（也可手动填集合变量 token）；\n3. 按顺序运行“01-正常流程”，游标由每条请求的 Tests 脚本自动写入集合变量；\n4. 再运行“02-边界与异常”，验证非法游标、空标签、未登录与重复游标稳定性。\n\n注意：\n- feed_limit 默认 2，便于在少量数据下触发多级游标翻页；\n- 公开接口在请求级设置为 noauth，避免集合级 Bearer Auth 干扰游客场景；\n- 关注流需要提前准备关注关系，否则返回空列表属于正常结果。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// 集合级前置脚本：初始化 feed 测试所需的游标与参数变量。",
          "const defaults = {",
          "  base_url: 'http://127.0.0.1:8080',",
          "  feed_limit: '2',",
          "  feed_tag: 'go',",
          "  missing_tag: 'definitely_no_such_tag_9527',",
          "  invalid_token: 'invalid.jwt.token',",
          "  login_username: 'feed_demo',",
          "  login_password: 'Passw0rd123',",
          "  latest_last_vid: '',",
          "  latest_last_created_at: '',",
          "  latest_page_ids: '[]',",
          "  stable_last_vid: '',",
          "  stable_last_created_at: '',",
          "  stable_first_vid_a: '',",
          "  popular_last_vid: '',",
          "  popular_last_popularity: '',",
          "  popular_page_ids: '[]',",
          "  likes_last_vid: '',",
          "  likes_last_likes_count: '',",
          "  likes_page_ids: '[]',",
          "  tag_last_vid: '',",
          "  tag_last_created_at: '',",
          "  tag_page_ids: '[]',",
          "  following_last_vid: '',",
          "  following_last_created_at: '',",
          "  following_page_ids: '[]'",
          "};",
          "Object.keys(defaults).forEach((key) => {",
          "  if (pm.collectionVariables.get(key) === undefined) {",
          "    pm.collectionVariables.set(key, defaults[key]);",
          "  }",
          "});",
          "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('token')) {",
          "  console.log('token 为空：请先运行登录请求或手动设置集合变量 token');",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
